---
description: >-
  A full usecase.* configuration sweep (actor/use-case font size, family,
  weight, node/rank spacing, diagram padding, useMaxWidth) on a simple
  sign-in/reset diagram that also carries an `accTitle` and a block-form
  `accDescr`.
config:
  usecase:
    actorFontSize: 16
    actorFontFamily: Arial
    actorFontWeight: bold
    usecaseFontSize: 14
    usecaseFontFamily: Georgia
    nodeSpacing: 60
    rankSpacing: 70
    diagramPadding: 24
    useMaxWidth: false
---
usecase-beta
  direction LR
  accTitle: Account access use cases
  accDescr {
    A customer signs in and can reset a password.
    The diagram names the actor, use cases, and associations.
  }

  actor Customer
  SignIn("Sign in")
  Reset("Reset password")

  Customer --> SignIn
  Customer --> Reset
